option.BIOME_WEATHER_VARIATION.comment = Makes weather patterns respond to the climate of the current biome.
option.WIND_INTENSITY_OVERRIDE           = Wind Intensity Override
option.WIND_INTENSITY_OVERRIDE.comment   = Sets the baseline wind intensity when Random Variation is disabled. Weather conditions and Windiness Bias can still affect the final wind strength.
