option.SHADOW.comment = Enables shadow mapping for the scene.
option.SHADOW_PCF.comment = Uses percentage-closer filtering to soften shadow-map edges.
option.SHADOW_SSRT.comment = Extends shadowing beyond the shadow-map distance using screen-space ray tracing.
option.SHADOW_COLOR_STRENGTH            = Tint Strength
option.SHADOW_COLOR_STRENGTH.comment    = Controls how strongly colored shadows retain the tint of the surface that casts them.
option.SHADOW_PCF_ITERATIONS            = Filter Iterations
option.SHADOW_PCF_ITERATIONS.comment    = Sets the maximum number of samples used to filter shadow-map edges.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS                  = Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment          = Adjusts the overall softness of filtered shadows.
option.BLOCK_ENTITY_SHADOWS.comment = Allows block entities, such as chests and signs, to cast shadows.
option.PIXELATED_SHADOWS_RESOLUTION.comment = Sets the pixel grid size used to align shadows with block texels.
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY = SSS Sheen Intensity
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the strength of the specular sheen effect on plants and leaves.
option.NETHER_USE_BIOME_COLOR.comment = Uses the biome color when calculating Nether lighting.
option.COLORED_LIGHTS_VANILLA_LIGHTMAP_CONTRIBUTION.comment = Allows the vanilla lightmap to contribute to the colored-lighting result.
option.VANILLA_SUN.comment = Displays the vanilla sun texture in the sky.
option.VANILLA_MOON.comment = Displays the vanilla moon texture in the sky.
option.RAINBOW_INTENSITY                 = Rainbow Intensity
option.RAINBOW_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the brightness of the rainbow effect.
option.SKY_GROUND_INTENSITY              = Sky Ground Brightness
option.SKY_GROUND_INTENSITY.comment      = Controls the brightness of the visible ground below the horizon when Sky Ground is enabled.
option.LIGHTNING_FLASH_INTENSITY         = Lightning Flash Intensity
option.LIGHTNING_FLASH_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the brightness of cloud illumination during lightning flashes.
option.CREPUSCULAR_RAYS.comment = Enables visible light rays passing through gaps in the clouds.
option.LIGHTNING_FLASH.comment = Adds flashes of light to the clouds during thunderstorms.
option.RAINBOWS.comment = Displays rainbows when weather and sunlight conditions allow them to appear.
option.END_SUN_EFFECT.comment = Adds a stylized solar glow effect to the sky in the End.
option.CLOUDS_NOCTILUCENT.comment = Enables high-altitude noctilucent clouds.
option.AURORA_NORMAL.comment = Sets how frequently auroras appear in biomes that are not snowy.
option.AURORA_SNOW.comment = Sets how frequently auroras appear in snowy biomes.
option.POM.comment = Enables parallax occlusion mapping for supported resource-pack textures.
option.RAIN_PUDDLES.comment = Creates reflective puddles on suitable surfaces during rain.
option.REFRACTION.comment = Selects which surfaces receive screen-space refraction.
option.WATER_WAVES.comment = Enables animated wave patterns on the water surface.
option.BLOOM_UPSAMPLING_FILTER.comment = Selects the filter used when upscaling the bloom effect.
option.tonemap.comment = Selects the tone-mapping operator used to convert HDR colors for display.
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE.comment = Selects the method used to calculate automatic exposure.
option.DH_OVERDRAW_DISTANCE.comment = Sets how far Distant Horizons terrain is rendered beyond the normal world render distance.
option.DH_OVERDRAW_FADE_LENGTH.comment = Controls the distance over which Distant Horizons terrain fades out at the edge of its overdraw range.
option.NOISE_ON_DH_TERRAIN.comment = Applies shader noise to Distant Horizons terrain.
option.PHOTONICS_ENABLED.comment = Enables the Photonics shader integration when the mod is installed.
option.PHOTONICS_SHARP_MAX_SAMPLES.comment = Sets the maximum number of light samples traced by the Sharp lighting mode. Higher values can improve light coverage at an additional performance cost.
option.PHOTONICS_RESTIR_INITIAL_SAMPLES.comment = Sets the number of initial light samples generated for each ReSTIR update. Higher values improve the initial lighting estimate but require more work.
option.PHOTONICS_RESTIR_SPR_SAMPLES.comment = Sets the number of spatial reuse samples used by ReSTIR. Set it to 0 to disable spatial reuse.
option.PHOTONICS_RESTIR_SPR_RADIUS.comment = Controls the search radius used to find nearby samples for ReSTIR spatial reuse. Larger radii can reuse more samples but may reduce locality.
option.PHOTONICS_RESTIR_DENOISER_PASSES.comment = Sets how many denoising passes are applied to ReSTIR lighting. More passes can reduce noise at an additional performance cost.
option.PHOTONICS_RESTIR_SOFT_SHADOWS.comment = Enables soft shadowing for the ReSTIR lighting mode.
